## Method

Collection pulled live from Untapped.gg API via Chrome MCP. Archetype list pulled live from Untapped.gg's analytics endpoint for meta period 722 (Bronze-to-Mythic, last 30 days). 25 archetypes filtered to those whose color identity bitmask is a subset of the Mardu wedge (W|B|R, no U, no G) and whose mythic-tier match count is at least 30. Each candidate card's deck-compatibility count is the number of those archetypes whose color identity bitmask is a superset of the card's color identity.

